---
  config:
    layout: elk
    look: neo
    theme: neutral
---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    title: GUI-6 - State Voting Equipment Summary
    actor User
    box Frontend
        participant LandingPage as landingPage#58;DOMNode
        participant Dropdown as dropDown#58;DOMNode
        participant Table as table#58;DOMNode

        participant Axios as #58;Axios
    end

    box Backend
        participant Controller as #58;Controller
        participant Service as #58;Service
        participant DB as #58;Repository
    end

    note right of DB: IVoterEquipmentDAO in codebase

    User->>LandingPage: Click State
    note left of LandingPage: Visits /state/{fipsCode}

    activate LandingPage
    activate Controller
    activate Dropdown
    LandingPage->>Dropdown: Render
    User->>Dropdown: Select 'Voting Equipment Option'
    Dropdown->>Table: Render
    activate Table

    Table->>Axios: getAllVotingEquipment(fipsCode, 2024)
    note left of Axios: We use Orval to generate typesafe request wrappers
    activate Axios

    Axios->>Controller: GET /votingequipment/?regionId={fipsCode}
    Axios->>Controller: getAllVotingEquipment(fipsCode, year=2024)
    note left of Controller: year=2024, is a default query parameter
    note left of Controller: Same endpoint as fetching ALL voting equipments.
    
    note left of Controller: For simplicity, we are omitting the Servlet + Jackson Serialization<br/>step, the full-flow of events is shown in the diagram for GUI-2: Display State.
    activate Service
    activate DB
    Controller->>Service: getAllVotingEquipment(fipsCode, year=2024)

    Service->>DB: getAllVotingEquipment(fipsCode, year=2024)
    note left of DB: Calls into our custom ORM solution, performing row mapping<br/>(simplified, full-flow in GUI-2: Display State).
    DB-->>Service: List<VotingEquipmentModel>
    Service-->>Controller: List<VotingEquipmentModel>
    deactivate Service
    deactivate DB
    note left of Controller: Would be serialized into a JSON string

    Controller-->>Axios: HTTP 200 OK: JSONString
    deactivate Axios

    Axios-->>Table: List<VotingEquipmentModel>
    note right of Table: Rendered with the help of mui-datagrid, handles pagination.
    deactivate Table
    deactivate Dropdown
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate LandingPage